<title>CANADA: CANADA JUNE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCT PRICE INDEX FALLS 0.</title>
<headline>CANADA JUNE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCT PRICE INDEX FALLS 0.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Tuesday issued the following economic indicators for June.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCT PRICE INDEX</p>
<p>					   Month-on-Month   Year-on-Year</p>
<p>    Change				 -0.2		 +1.0</p>
<p>					   June 97   May 97    June 96</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=86)	    130.4     130.6     129.1</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCT PRICE INDEX   Month-on-Month   Year-on-Year</p>
<p>    Intermediate goods		 -0.2		 +0.4</p>
<p>    Finished goods		     -0.1		 +2.1</p>
<p>The IPPI reflects the prices producers receive as goods</p>
